    <item>
      <title>Data Science Intern @ CODMAV (PES University)</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/experience/codmav/</link>
      <pubDate>Sat, 01 Jun 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/experience/codmav/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h3 id=&#34;role-overview&#34;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Science Intern&lt;/strong&gt; | &lt;em&gt;June 2024 – Aug 2024&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;My internship at the Centre of Data Modelling, Analytics and Visualization (CODMAV) was focused on healthcare analytics, specifically leveraging machine learning for early disease detection.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;key-projects&#34;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Projects&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lung Cancer Risk Prediction System&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/sumukhacharya03/Lung-Cancer-ML&#34;&gt;View GitHub Repository&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Led the development of a &lt;strong&gt;Lung Cancer Risk Prediction System&lt;/strong&gt; for early-stage risk assessment.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Preperation:&lt;/strong&gt; Performed extensive data cleaning and preprocessing, including &lt;strong&gt;Random Forest&lt;/strong&gt; based missing value imputation.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dimensionality Reduction:&lt;/strong&gt; I applied advanced feature selection techniques such as &lt;strong&gt;PCA (Principal Component Analysis)&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;BSO&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;RFE (Recursive Feature Elimination)&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong&gt;SelectKBest&lt;/strong&gt; to optimize the dataset for training.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;The final feature set was &lt;strong&gt;validated&lt;/strong&gt; by a &lt;strong&gt;doctor&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Model Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Implemented and tuned multiple machine learning models including &lt;strong&gt;XGBoost&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;CatBoost&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;SVM&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong&gt;KNN&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Results:&lt;/strong&gt; Developed an Ensemble Model that combined the strengths of individual classifiers, achieving a peak accuracy of &lt;strong&gt;98.75%&lt;/strong&gt; and a recall of &lt;strong&gt;96.25%&lt;/strong&gt; for the &lt;strong&gt;RFE-selected features&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;research--publication&#34;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Research &amp;amp; Publication&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Conducted in-depth research on Lung Cancer markers and ML techniques.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Co-authored a research paper titled &lt;em&gt;&amp;ldquo;Predictive Analytics for Early Lung Cancer Risk using Machine Learning,&amp;rdquo;&lt;/em&gt; which was accepted and published in &lt;strong&gt;IEEE Xplore&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/document/11256225&#34;&gt;View Publication&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;</description>
    </item>
